  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Your Zakat transforms 12,000 students&apos; learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teach For Pakistan Fellows - outstanding university graduates - teach full-time in public schools, accelerating learning for students who are on average 4 years behind grade-level. As our students strive to close the achievement gap, they face a shortage of everyday learning resources, e.g., stationery, reference books/materials and copying funds. Your Zakat, sadqa, and donations equip 12,000 students across rural Islamabad with the tools to build the tomorrow of their dreams.</narrative>
  </description>
